he moment if your interested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T23:56:19-07:00","id":1384583,"title":"","content":"RPG.net is a solid and well done community. It also banned me so you know they know their shit.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1381679-v5-speculation-alternate-rules-in-pg?p=1384578#post1384578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Taggie let it go, your just gonna get banned. This is now a V5+ forum now, accept it and move on.<br /> <br /> On a more positive note there's a V20 PvP recruiting on rpg.net at the moment if your interested.</div> </div> </div> </div>Healthy discussion and even never wanting to play the game or thinking previous versions are far superior is fine.<br /> <br /> Just we no longer are going to say the game killed your childe or suggest the developers are plotting to drive you mad with coded messages.<br /> <br /> Or attack the posters who dislike other editions. V20 or V5.<br /> <br /> No more monomancy, only catty Toreador barbs that sound like compliments.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.co